# Infinigrams

A React-based Nonogram (Picross / Paint by Numbers) game with endless seedable puzzles and photo-to-puzzle generation.

## Features

- Multiple grid sizes (5×5 to 20×20)
- Three difficulty levels (Easy, Medium, Hard)
- Drag-to-fill gameplay with right-click X marks
- Victory wave animation
- Live timer
- Seed-based puzzle generation for sharing specific puzzles
- Create puzzles from uploaded photos

## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Node.js 18 or higher
- npm

### Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/stevenegnaczyk/infinigrams.git
cd infinigrams
npm install
npm run dev
```

## How to Play

1. Choose a grid size and difficulty, or paste a seed
2. Use the row/column number clues to fill the correct cells
3. Controls:
   - Left click/drag to paint filled cells (cycles fill → X → clear when clicking)
   - Right click/drag to mark cells with X
4. Complete the puzzle by filling every required cell

## Scripts

- `npm run dev` — start the Vite development server
- `npm run build` — typecheck and build for production
- `npm run preview` — preview the production build
- `npm run deploy` — build and publish to GitHub Pages

